官爵。常從上至長楊獵，是時天子方好自擊熊彘，馳逐野獸，相如上疏諫之。其辭曰：\n臣聞物有同類而殊能者，故力稱烏獲，捷言慶忌，勇期賁、育。臣之愚，竊以為人誠有之，獸亦宜然。今陛下好陵阻險，射猛獸，卒然遇軼材之獸，駭不存之地，犯屬車之清塵，輿不及還轅，人不暇施巧，雖有烏獲、逢蒙之伎，力不得用，枯木朽株盡為害矣。是胡越起於轂下，而羌夷接軫也，豈不殆哉！雖萬全無患，然本非天子之所宜近也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"卓氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"「卓氏」在此以家戶／氏族稱呼婚配，未直接寫出所娶者姓名。卓王孫女文君是篇內候選，但此詞不作她的個人名，也不單憑氏族稱呼連到人物卡。"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"相如","kind":"person","person_id":"usb_lgr_ksa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"烏獲","kind":"person","person_id":"rzv_0ll_3ty","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"慶忌","kind":"person","person_id":"n7l_j5p_4wl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"賁","kind":"person","person_id":"dwv_5hn_680","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"育","kind":"person","person_id":"66l_m67_5ie","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m045-0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"烏獲","kind":"person","person_id":"rzv_0ll_3ty","stat